# An entry file that is also a building block. `use_entry.ramo` imports its `tile` def.
# use_entry_part.png: one tile centered at (32,32): a blue 24x24 square with an ink outline and a gold circle (r 6) at its center.
@artboard 64x64
@target targets/use_entry_part.png

def tile tone:p.blue
  rect 24x24 fill:tone stroke:p.ink,2
  circle 6 fill:p.gold

tile name:t at:32,32
